{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8c2731c6-df58-883f-a5e1-0945783e44d5",
  "created_at": "2026-02-06T08:55:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Mike A. Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T08:53:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Newport Recreation, this is Beth, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T08:53:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. I'm calling about the beach parks. What time does the park close in winter? I'm talking about the one by the water, the town beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T08:53:40-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. In the winter the beach parks are open dawn to dusk, so it moves around a bit. Right now that's roughly sunrise to a little after five in the evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T08:53:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so around five-ish. Not a hard time on a gate or anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T08:53:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, not a set time. If there's a gate on a lot, that can be locked when it gets dark, so I'd not leave a car in there after sunset."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T08:54:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Oh, and by the way, are the bathrooms open this time of year? Or is that a no."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T08:54:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Most of the seasonal restrooms are closed until spring. I can't promise about every single one, though. Let me check with the parks crew on that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T08:54:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine, I figured. Anyway, back to the first thing. Dawn to dusk, so five and change. That's what I needed. Sorry, Barb, did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T08:54:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's Beth, actually. Beth Almeida. No worries, happens all the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T08:54:49-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Beth. Sorry about that. Bad connection, I'm on my cell. So Beth, will I need to call back about any of this? Like is there a follow-up on your end?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T08:55:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not for the hours, you're all set there. If you want a firm answer on the restrooms I'll ask the parks folks and call you back. Do you want that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T08:55:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nah, I don't need it. If I'm wrong I'll just deal with it. So no follow-up call needed then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T08:55:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nope, nothing else needed from you. You're good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T08:55:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, great. Thanks, Beth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T08:55:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good Friday!"
    }
  ],
